    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/listening-01.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/listening-01.wav",
      "script": "アキのノートは、あおです。あかのノートは、ユイのです。アキのノートをください。",
      "sha256": "a554f8d0b94c1f36e7d17d742277f48e3f13798798cb30eb400145c3d79d26cf",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/listening-02.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/listening-02.wav",
      "script": "これはリクのふでばこです。これはユイのけしゴムです。リクのものは、ふでばこです。",
      "sha256": "c0b5107bf76609c472524530ed6410de5f49efbf55fa609f551874fbfcccd1db",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/listening-03.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/listening-03.wav",
      "script": "それは、あなたのじょうぎですか。はい、わたしのじょうぎです。あのはさみは、せんせいのです。せんせいのはさみをください。",
      "sha256": "1683a64e094ebf814a5dbe727ddb72f279ff1fff83ee0b7114f441bdc1f3adc2",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/listening-04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/listening-04.wav",
      "script": "このノートは、わたしのです。そのペンをください。はい、どうぞ。",
      "sha256": "dc8206dab89e10f7be09fb39bfa1620baec3c9746a960eab92c0ac0656c0cd0b",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/listening-05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/listening-05.wav",
      "script": "これは、きょうかしょですか。",
      "sha256": "ff1e697c4ffb4674067af8e51bc8052a76b05e88d8709aa4b83a940df2d8d4fc",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/listening-06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/listening-06.wav",
      "script": "そのふでばこは、だれのですか。",
      "sha256": "143fbeeac2264616e2ddeac74056435eb3ac8740f08a829b29c5f625d5370ade",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-1.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-1.wav",
      "script": "ノート。ペン。ボールペン。けしゴム。じょうぎ。",
      "sha256": "5d030e504c1333eafbf885c025489fef009154c4fda848fc371988ca5598ed22",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-2.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-2.wav",
      "script": "はさみ。かみ。きょうかしょ。じしょ。こくばん。",
      "sha256": "20f2d02ab99d93db3e54b899fa7ff59b1d8444fcd6e4d11bd0761cc062da0a03",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-3.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-3.wav",
      "script": "チョーク。まど。ドア。とけい。ふでばこ。",
      "sha256": "e0db48b34294394c9ff9c428a3120c393a84fdf30edf60be529582cffa0ba681",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-4.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-4.wav",
      "script": "え。ちず。きょうしつ。がっこう。たな。",
      "sha256": "44a2291c657fade6d920fc7c288350d2c27be7fcf7dea468bc3a4c1db504638f",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-5.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-words-5.wav",
      "script": "はこ。ほんだな。ぶん。あか。あお。",
      "sha256": "c5e16440b5b9889eb832cdd7b51ce3bf915da2b04a95f07d0788ff18bcf1bd1a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-kanji.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-kanji.wav",
      "script": "がっこう。せんせい。ぶん。",
      "sha256": "5f32849cf9ef08d621db0465d9b50b0c59cc567f21676e9613098c6ed30587dd",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-G04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-G04.wav",
      "script": "これはペンです。それはノートです。あれはとけいです。",
      "sha256": "48865cd46a1e9ca9385654d64b51500d722a69ac5501b94e34e9a2c71d983385",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-G05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-G05.wav",
      "script": "このノートはあおです。そのふでばこはあかです。あのとけいです。",
      "sha256": "7201ec74178f7493204ffb89c8c77285824b9dd551accbda062b4e636f4a031a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-G06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-G06.wav",
      "script": "わたしのノート。せんせいのチョーク。これはアキのじょうぎです。",
      "sha256": "25fb8bf6963a41d7c67bc0b87157d8d8877e234789fc8302efca963aa986e3ca",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-story.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u02/U02-teach-story.wav",
      "script": "そのじょうぎをください。はい、どうぞ。これはなんですか。だれのふでばこですか。ちがいます。",
      "sha256": "fb989389311673273d48d9907c63a862ec6e859f36189b0326b002244ae6348a",
